# Line endings: LF everywhere in the repository, whatever system commits.
# This is not fussiness. The templates of templates/ go into Anki as they are
# (notetypes.py copies them there), and the instructions of prompts/*/*.md go
# to the model as they are: a stray \r ends up there, without ever showing.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries: never any conversion, it would corrupt them.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.m4a binary
*.ico binary
